8	 * Rejects an owner request whose email domain is on the disposable-domain blocklist with
9	 * 400. Runs after {@link NormalizeOwnerEmail} has validated the syntax and lower-cased the
10	 * address, so the domain is simply the text after the '@'. An absent email is allowed. A
11	 * disposable-<em>adjacent</em> domain (a subdomain of a blocked one) is not rejected here but
12	 * later raises the owner's risk flag (see {@link DisposableDomains} and {@link ResolveRiskFlag}).
13	 */
14	public class RejectDisposableEmail {
15	
16	    public void service(@Val OwnerFieldsDto request) throws DisposableEmailException {
